i di protezione individuale possono trasformarsi rapidamente in situazioni pericolose. Imparate a riconoscere tempestivamente i pericoli e ad agire in modo sicuro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JMqx7Qq7sE8Q7kNvwH10GO4&_nc_oc=AdqTqkuX0ccMruuWBmPPIYKIKN0IeFYL9nFB87bDmzYDhmTzCcR635KnSryByS8SGa8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQHE1sUTOCWAdTdw-fKlOCZFYce1B3CZvzDU-x-S84YjA&oe=6AEA1563"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=U3_cZjAzQV4Q7kNvwHbNgF5&_nc_oc=Ado2xsZGghonxkOWoYW5DDlnGssrs18Zwg0q_ibK1Vbmya_XKGZVP2m_-GfjhNWQ8RA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSyup5vKaB3S6ky-wPI7zCxmaNUDVdejH9WM5VJ2-14Pg&oe=6AEA015D"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KN1nnFxb2WwQ7kNvwHVXy6W&_nc_oc=AdrjCXs23ReQVrji1fohh9EyiEDFxrORNNq2sk35uNpyQZ_TjOIkSEHUSfHE-skwp0c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRqW9yvqMKk36s1nUcq306L7xNMf8fZwGROkefo2v4pbw&oe=6AE9EFCA"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1061729109131103", "im